{"id":"n48707-1-6","stage":5,"title":"덤 · 附赠","scene":"工作与经济","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n48707-1-6-1","ko":"아가씨, 덤으로 화장품 몇 개 더 챙겨 주면 안 돼요?","zh":"小姐，能再免费多给我几样化妆品吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아가씨,","meaning":"小姐","explanation":"아가씨：小姐","readings":[{"term":"아가씨","audio":"/audio/3c99ce3d4775969b8c09.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65973","senseId":"1","lemma":"아가씨","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"덤으로","meaning":"附赠，赠品，搭头","explanation":"덤：附赠，赠品，搭头；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"덤","audio":"/audio/e2a22fdf54db75037517.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48707","senseId":"1","lemma":"덤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"화장품","meaning":"化妆品","explanation":"화장품：化妆品","readings":[{"term":"화장품","audio":"/audio/740b80a0f4f8ee4087dd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73232","senseId":"1","lemma":"화장품","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"몇","meaning":"几","explanation":"몇：几","readings":[{"term":"몇","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66235","senseId":"1","lemma":"몇","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"개","meaning":"个","explanation":"개：个","readings":[{"term":"개","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"22784","senseId":"1","lemma":"개","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"더","meaning":"再，多","explanation":"더：再，多","readings":[{"term":"더","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26829","senseId":"1","lemma":"더","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"챙겨","meaning":"收拾，整理，准备","explanation":"챙기다：收拾，整理，准备；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"챙기다","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29778","senseId":"1","lemma":"챙기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"주면","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"돼요?","meaning":"能，行","explanation":"되다：能，行；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"21","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3c99ce3d4775969b","term":"아가씨","zh":"小姐","audio":"/audio/3c99ce3d4775969b8c09.mp3","entryId":"65973","definition":"未结婚的年轻女子。","pronunciation":["아가씨"]},{"id":"e2a22fdf54db7503","term":"덤","zh":"附赠，赠品，搭头","audio":"/audio/e2a22fdf54db75037517.mp3","entryId":"48707","definition":"支付规定价格的东西以外免费再给一些东西；或指那么给的东西。","pronunciation":["덤ː"]},{"id":"740b80a0f4f8ee40","term":"화장품","zh":"化妆品","audio":"/audio/740b80a0f4f8ee4087dd.mp3","entryId":"73232","definition":"为了美观或护理皮肤而涂抹在脸上的物品。","pronunciation":["화장품"]},{"id":"37ca98883f5001d4","term":"몇","zh":"几","audio":"/audio/37ca98883f5001d4cce6.mp3","entryId":"66235","definition":"数目不定的小数字。","pronunciation":["멷"]},{"id":"a57ab05712bfb600","term":"개","zh":"个","audio":"/audio/a57ab05712bfb600cb4b.mp3","entryId":"22784","definition":"计算单个东西的计量单位。","pronunciation":["개"]},{"id":"1e2cb79b6970d021","term":"더","zh":"再，多","audio":"/audio/1e2cb79b6970d0213fd9.mp3","entryId":"26829","definition":"添补而继续。","pronunciation":["더"]},{"id":"39b299d8d470abe5","term":"챙기다","zh":"收拾，整理，准备","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3","entryId":"29778","definition":"寻找所需之物并携带，或观察是否携带齐全。","pronunciation":["챙기다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","ent